  displayName: Trading Outpost
  role: Trade post beside a veilstone outcrop - buys veilstone with supplies and
    iron, or forges veilstone into veilsteel
  description: Raise it beside an uncursed or depleted veilstone outcrop - it snaps
    to a free side (north, east, south or west), up to four posts per outcrop, each
    further post there costing more to build and to level. Trade mode buys veilstone
    with supplies and iron; Forge mode turns veilstone into veilsteel.
